    "referenceSolution": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <set>\n#include <map>\n#include <queue>\n#include <deque>\n#include <stack>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <climits>\n#include <utility>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){string s,p,r,t;cin>>s>>p>>r;for(int i=0;i<(int)s.size();)if(s.compare(i,p.size(),p)==0){t+=r;i+=p.size();}else t+=s[i++];cout<<t<<'\\n';}\n",
    "pythonReference": "s=input();p=input();r=input();a=[];i=0\nwhile i<len(s):\n    if s.startswith(p,i):a.append(r);i+=len(p)\n    else:a.append(s[i]);i+=1\nprint(''.join(a))\n"
